has a pure heart, but because she’s been living in seclusion in the mountains, she’s a bit out of touch with the outside world."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c20350"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"【妹神拳正統継承者】"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"お兄ちゃんのイチバンになるためだけに、高野の山奥で修行をしていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そこで、謎の人物から「妹神拳」という拳法を学ぶことになる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"真っ直ぐな心の持ち主だが、山ごもりをしていたため、少し世間とずれている部分も。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「己の目的はただ一つ。お兄ちゃんのイチバンになるッ！」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"4603","sourceWorkId":"17835","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"お兄ちゃんのイチバンになるためだけに、高野の山奥で修行をしていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そこで、謎の人物から “妹神拳” という拳法を学ぶことになる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"真っ直ぐな心の持ち主だが、山籠りをしていたため、少し世間とズレている部分も。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「己の目的はただ一つ。お兄ちゃんのイチバンになるッ!!」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"37890"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"性格","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"37890","value":"義理人情に厚い、熱血タイプの正統派番長。 お兄ちゃん大好きで、甘えたがり屋な一面も。"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b3/b33b8229347cf95edbdae3260a11ae3db1d0fe3f97527ce08cfdee6468741a04.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ef/ef1aa2db0febadf7665bb6e519724789e08166a20060ab0d074acdcd32b5b112.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"花澤さくら","creatorId":"vndb:s947","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s947","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s947","name":"花澤 さくら","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:52815:37890:17075:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c27407","characterName":"乃神 ましろ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"37892","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"52815"}],"egsCharacterIds":["4605"],"vndbCharacterId":"c27407"},"originalCharacterName":"乃神 ましろ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"sour